{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t消防處表示，已完成海洋摩天塔故障的救援行動。<br/>\n<br/>\n處方表示，下午3時30分接報，指海洋公園的海洋摩天塔發生故障，有市民受困。消防人員到場，40名被困人士獲海洋公園職員陪同，沿後備樓梯撤離。另外，一名女子感到不適，由消防處高空拯救專隊人員使用高空拯救工具帶回地面。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:56.937014+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:07:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:57.635859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:57.635859+00:00","content_hash":"b915e4d9a7b5610bd14910fd59527cb3c8e08ac6a4c963bc13660c603546f431","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}